1
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:36,500
Mister,

2
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:37,960
thank you for saving me.

3
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:39,560
Yeah.

4
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,220
By the way, mister,

5
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,130
I saw a huge, terrifying eye

6
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,960
deep in the cold pool.

7
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,900
Could there be an evil spirit
in this cold pool?

8
00:00:57,930 --> 00:00:59,590
There is nothing in the water.

9
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:00,960
You were frightened,

10
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:02,560
so you saw it wrong.

11
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,060
Go back and rest.

12
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:05,300
Impossible.

13
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,830
I definitely didn't see it wrong.

14
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:07,360
I really...

15
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,490
Go back and rest now.

16
00:01:14,330 --> 00:01:15,900
Oh, okay.

17
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:17,500
Fine.

18
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:28,060
Sigh.

19
00:01:28,430 --> 00:01:29,930
Are you punishing me?

20
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,930
What did I do wrong?

21
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:38,259
This bell...

22
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:40,120
The demonic cult is invading!

23
00:01:49,229 --> 00:01:51,890
He said he wanted me
to supervise Bai's writing,

24
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:54,400
but he actually wanted Bai to spy on me.

25
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:02,730
Bai,

26
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:04,430
let's go out for a walk.

27
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:08,160
The old monster asked me
to read and write.

28
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,560
I don't dare to slack off.

29
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:13,830
Oh.

30
00:02:18,260 --> 00:02:20,730
Everyone knows the Yan Sect is powerful.

31
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:23,390
Why would the demonic cult come to die?

32
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:27,200
Do they want something?

33
00:02:29,430 --> 00:02:32,160
If there is something they want
from the Yan Sect,

34
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,630
it should

35
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:36,530
be this.

36
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:37,730
It's empty.

37
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:42,760
No wonder it's so quiet.

38
00:02:43,130 --> 00:02:44,800
The demonic cult is invading outside,

39
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,530
but they are sleeping soundly.

40
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:00,300
Looks like it's time
to consider making fish soup.

41
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,200
Red beans grow in the southern land,

42
00:03:18,230 --> 00:03:20,060
how many branches sprout in spring?

43
00:03:20,060 --> 00:03:21,430
I hope you gather more,

44
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:25,000
for this thing represents
lovesickness the most.

45
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:35,500
This poem...

46
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,260
lovesickness.

47
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:39,760
Who is she missing?

48
00:03:50,829 --> 00:03:51,630
Sister.

49
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:58,860
I definitely didn't
see it wrong yesterday.

50
00:03:58,860 --> 00:04:01,590
There must be something wrong
with the cold pool.

51
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:04,830
I have to go again

52
00:04:04,930 --> 00:04:06,000
and figure it out.

53
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,900
You still want to follow me?

54
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:12,130
I shook you off.

55
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:32,200
Wow, there's actually a hot spring here,

56
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:35,390
and it smells like flowers.

57
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,700
Madam thinks she shook us off.

58
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:44,730
What should we do next?

59
00:04:44,730 --> 00:04:46,060
The sect leader has ordered

60
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:47,600
that we cannot trespass here.

61
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,860
Let's just wait here.

62
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,960
It must be very comfortable
to take a bath here.

63
00:04:58,930 --> 00:04:59,960
Are you...

64
00:05:02,330 --> 00:05:03,930
going to take a bath with me?

65
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:15,700
See no

66
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:17,600
evil!

67
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:20,900
Did no one tell you

68
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:24,590
that you are not allowed to enter here?

69
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,300
No,

70
00:05:34,659 --> 00:05:35,930
what am I expecting?
